{"seq":7,"slug":"lc0315-count-of-smaller-numbers","title":"LeetCode 315 计算右侧小于当前元素的个数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/hard-advanced-ds/lc0315-count-of-smaller-numbers","wordCount":941,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-315-计算右侧小于当前元素的个数\">LeetCode 315 计算右侧小于当前元素的个数</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>给你一个整数数组 <code>nums</code>，按要求返回一个新数组 <code>counts</code>。数组 <code>counts</code> 有该性质：<code>counts[i]</code> 的值是 <code>nums[i]</code> 右侧小于 <code>nums[i]</code> 的元素的数量。</p>\n<p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>1 &lt;= nums.length &lt;= 10^5</code></li>\n<li><code>-10^4 &lt;= nums[i] &lt;= 10^4</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 1：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：nums = [5,2,6,1]&#10;输出：[2,1,1,0]&#10;解释：&#10;  5 的右侧有 2 和 1 共 2 个更小的元素&#10;  2 的右侧有 1 共 1 个更小的元素&#10;  6 的右侧有 1 共 1 个更小的元素&#10;  1 的右侧没有更小的元素\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：nums = [5,2,6,1]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：[2,1,1,0]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>解释：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  5 的右侧有 2 和 1 共 2 个更小的元素</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  2 的右侧有 1 共 1 个更小的元素</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  6 的右侧有 1 共 1 个更小的元素</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  1 的右侧没有更小的元素</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>示例 2：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：nums = [-1]&#10;输出：[0]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：nums = [-1]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：[0]</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>示例 3：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：nums = [-1,-1]&#10;输出：[0,0]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：nums = [-1,-1]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：[0,0]</span></span></code></pre></div><p>本题是经典的&quot;逆序对&quot;变体问题。暴力方法 O(n²) 超时，需要借助归并排序或树状数组将时间降为 O(n log n)。</p>\n<h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><p><strong>方法一：归并排序</strong></p>\n<p>归并排序在合并两个有序子数组时，天然可以统计逆序对数量。对于左半部分的元素 <code>nums[i]</code> 和右半部分的元素 <code>nums[j]</code>，如果 <code>nums[i] &gt; nums[j]</code>，则 <code>nums[j]</code> 对 <code>nums[i]</code> 贡献了一个&quot;右侧更小元素&quot;。</p>\n<p>关键：我们需要知道每个元素最初在原数组中的位置，因此需要将索引与值绑定排序。</p>\n<p><strong>方法二：树状数组（从右到左扫描）</strong></p>\n<p>从右到左遍历数组，对于每个元素 <code>nums[i]</code>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>先查询树状数组中小于 <code>nums[i]</code> 的元素个数，即 <code>prefixSum(nums[i] - 1)</code></li>\n<li>然后将 <code>nums[i]</code> 插入树状数组（对应位置加 1）</li>\n</ol>\n<p>由于元素值可能为负数，需要做值域偏移（将最小值映射为 1）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>暴力</td>\n<td>O(n²)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>超时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>归并排序</td>\n<td>O(n log n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>分治思想，原地统计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>树状数组</td>\n<td>O(n log M)</td>\n<td>O(M)</td>\n<td>M 为值域大小</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><p><strong>方法一：归并排序（推荐）</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function countSmaller(nums: number[]): number[] {&#10;  const n = nums.length;&#10;  const counts = new Array(n).fill(0);&#10;  const indices = Array.from({ length: n }, (_, i) =&gt; i);&#10;  const tempIndices = new Array(n).fill(0);&#10;&#10;  function mergeSort(left: number, right: number): void {&#10;    if (left &gt;= right) return;&#10;&#10;    const mid = (left + right) &gt;&gt; 1;&#10;    mergeSort(left, mid);&#10;    mergeSort(mid + 1, right);&#10;&#10;    let i = left;&#10;    let j = mid + 1;&#10;    let k = left;&#10;&#10;    while (i &lt;= mid &amp;&amp; j &lt;= right) {&#10;      if (nums[indices[i]] &lt;= nums[indices[j]]) {&#10;        counts[indices[i]] += j - (mid + 1);&#10;        tempIndices[k++] = indices[i++];&#10;      } else {&#10;        tempIndices[k++] = indices[j++];&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    while (i &lt;= mid) {&#10;      counts[indices[i]] += j - (mid + 1);&#10;      tempIndices[k++] = indices[i++];&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    while (j &lt;= right) {&#10;      tempIndices[k++] = indices[j++];&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    for (let p = left; p &lt;= right; p++) {&#10;      indices[p] = tempIndices[p];&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  mergeSort(0, n - 1);&#10;  return counts;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> countSmaller</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">nums</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> counts</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fill</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> indices</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Array.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ length: n }, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> tempIndices</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fill</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"colo